@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam BorderColor #334155
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B6A16C
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
title UC-01  Account access and applications
' Requirements: PERM-01 PERM-05 ACC-01 ACC-02 ACC-03 ACC-04 ACC-05 ACC-06 ACC-07 ACC-08 ACC-09 ACC-10 ACC-13 ACC-14 ACC-15 ACC-16 ACC-17 ACC-20 NOTICE-01 NOTICE-02
left to right direction
actor "Applicant or account holder" as A
rectangle "CS-GAMUERS: account access" {
  usecase "Register and verify email" as U0
  usecase "View application status\nand correct an application" as U1
  usecase "Accept an invitation" as U2
  usecase "Sign in with approved permissions" as U3
  usecase "Reset a forgotten password" as U4
  usecase "Request assisted email recovery" as U5
  usecase "Deactivate own student account" as U6
}
A -- U0
A -- U1
A -- U2
A -- U3
A -- U4
A -- U5
A -- U6
note bottom of A
Registration: Students and Faculty only.
Invitations: Administrators and Program Heads.
Pending applicants have application access only.
Self-deactivation: Students only.
Each account has exactly one role.
Other roles use Administrator-managed deactivation.
end note
footer CS-GAMUERS | UC-01 | Product behavior
@enduml
